  "raw_html": "<p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">一日游规划路线几乎包括故宫博物院所有开放区域的重要宫殿和展馆，但也请您在参观时注意利用时间，并选择好自己感兴趣的展览陈列内容，若处处盘桓流连，一天的时间恐怕也不足以尽览胜景。</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">&nbsp</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">1.&nbsp<a href=\"/explore/building/236454.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">午门</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">2.&nbsp<a href=\"/explore/building/236500.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">武英殿</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">3.&nbsp<a href=\"/explore/building/236531.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">文华殿（书画馆）</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">4.&nbsp<a href=\"/explore/building/236439.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">太和门</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">5.&nbsp<a href=\"/explore/building/236465.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">太和殿</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">6.&nbsp<a href=\"/explore/building/236464.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">中和殿</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">7.&nbsp<a href=\"/explore/building/236434.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">保和殿</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">8.&nbsp<a href=\"/explore/building/236472.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">乾清宫</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">9.&nbsp<a href=\"/explore/building/236467.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">交泰殿</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">10.<a href=\"/explore/building/236487.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">坤宁宫</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">11.<a href=\"/explore/building/236442.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">养心殿</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">12.西六宫区</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">13.<a href=\"/explore/building/236519.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">御花园</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">14.东六宫区</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">15.<a href=\"/explore/building/236430.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">奉先殿（钟表馆）</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">16.宁寿宫区（珍宝馆、戏曲馆）</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">17.<a href=\"/explore/building/236456.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">神武门</a></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">&nbsp</p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em\">&nbsp</p>",
